Kubernetes lab bootstrap

Run the playbooks from this directory. The inventory is configured in
ansible.cfg and points to inventory/hosts.ini.

Full bootstrap order:

ansible-playbook 00-preflight.yml
ansible-playbook 01-os-prep.yml
ansible-playbook 02-containerd.yml
ansible-playbook 03-kubernetes-packages.yml
ansible-playbook 04-kubeadm-init.yml
ansible-playbook 05-helm.yml
ansible-playbook 06-cilium-cli.yml
ansible-playbook 07-cilium-platform.yml \
  -e '{"cilium_lb_pool_blocks":[{"start":"192.168.1.80","stop":"192.168.1.89"}]}'
ansible-playbook 08-single-node.yml
ansible-playbook 09-validation.yml
ansible-playbook 10-metrics-server.yml
ansible-playbook 11-cert-manager.yml
ansible-playbook 13-local-storage.yml

Planned next platform playbooks:

12-monitoring.yml

Re-run a single playbook:

ansible-playbook <playbook>.yml

Re-run Cilium platform networking:

ansible-playbook 07-cilium-platform.yml \
  -e '{"cilium_lb_pool_blocks":[{"start":"192.168.1.80","stop":"192.168.1.89"}]}'

Syntax check:

ansible-playbook --syntax-check <playbook>.yml

